WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
So I'm thinking... Why don't we just blow this portal up?

2
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Why do we have to go there at all?

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
If everything was so simple... One day, the Architects will find a way back.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The Architects don't look for a way. They lay the Passage themselves.

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Yes, yes, we've heard enough of your almightiness. But we still haven't seen it with our own eyes.

6
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
And how do we know that this portal is not a one way ticket?

7
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Your metaphors are yet beyond my understanding.

8
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:08.000
You can't guarantee anything. But this is your only chance to win.

9
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:19.000
There's no time left. You have to go now.

10
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:25.000
We will protect Sarnaut! May the Light guard us!

11
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Fight as long as you can. This doesn't matter.
